{"4660830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "GeckoShop 2", "steam_appid": 4660830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Everything about GeckoShop 2:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GeckoShop 2 is a Creature Collector + Factory Builder, where you open boxes, collect rare geckos, breed mutations, build machines, and run your own gecko business!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Your dream of owning the ultimate gecko shop is back, bigger and deeper than ever. Get cozy collecting cute geckos, decorate your home, grow your garden, or build a perfect machine empire that does everything for you!&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open Boxes and collect a <strong>huge variety</strong> of colors and cosmetics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell your Geckos</strong> in your Shop or to customers on the island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breed Geckos</strong> in the Lab to create new <strong>Mutations</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accept Missions </strong>and fulfill custom bulk orders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Machines</strong> and connect them with tubes, to automate every single process.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plant Seeds and grow crops in your garden,</strong> to feed your Geckos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow Plants in your own garden to decorate your rooms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visit new islands</strong>, find <strong>Geodes</strong> and crack them to reveal rare gecko variants. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660830/extras/92bfeec0f95566041234952e766d42cb.poster.avif?t=1782461847\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660830/extras/92bfeec0f95566041234952e766d42cb.webm?t=1782461847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660830/extras/92bfeec0f95566041234952e766d42cb.mp4?t=1782461847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play with up to 5 additional friends.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite your Friends to one of your Worlds, and start from the beginning, or show them your entire production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split tasks and be productive, or have fun opening boxes and collecting together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660830/extras/e0225e5e91ee207f0c393d274d6c08a8.avif?t=1782461847\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660830/extras_big/e0225e5e91ee207f0c393d274d6c08a8.webp?t=1782461847 width=1560 height=384 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect, Breed, Sell, Repeat.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are tons of Geckos to discover, each with their own look, rarity, stats and value.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and open different Boxes to get random Geckos from that set.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your favorites and sell the valuable ones. Or send them to the Lab, to breed something completely new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660830/extras/6f278dc35839bfe74eb3c11b25a36164.poster.avif?t=1782461847\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660830/extras/6f278dc35839bfe74eb3c11b25a36164.webm?t=1782461847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660830/extras/6f278dc35839bfe74eb3c11b25a36164.mp4?t=1782461847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Machines for Everything.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every single task can be automated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open boxes, move geckos, sell products, breed mutations, incubate eggs, feed animals, harvest crops, manage orders and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start simple, then build bigger and faster machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660830/extras/e161ad22cd6a95eb0de94ed32660634f.avif?t=1782461847\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660830/extras_big/e161ad22cd6a95eb0de94ed32660634f.webp?t=1782461847 width=1560 height=384 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow a Garden to Feed your Geckos.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You now have your own Garden!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant Seeds to grow Fruits, catch Bugs, and use them to feed your Geckos. Grow useful resources, or plant beautiful decorations to make your rooms feel more alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decorate your Home and Keep your Collection.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Say hello to your own Home, that you can decorate however you want, and display your personal collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy home, a gecko museum, or a jungle of self-grown flowers?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Everything about GeckoShop 2:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GeckoShop 2 is a Creature Collector + Factory Builder, where you open boxes, collect rare geckos, breed mutations, build machines, and run your own gecko business!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Your dream of owning the ultimate gecko shop is back, bigger and deeper than ever. Get cozy collecting cute geckos, decorate your home, grow your garden, or build a perfect machine empire that does everything for you!&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open Boxes and collect a <strong>huge variety</strong> of colors and cosmetics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell your Geckos</strong> in your Shop or to customers on the island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breed Geckos</strong> in the Lab to create new <strong>Mutations</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accept Missions </strong>and fulfill custom bulk orders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Machines</strong> and connect them with tubes, to automate every single process.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plant Seeds and grow crops in your garden,</strong> to feed your Geckos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow Plants in your own garden to decorate your rooms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visit new islands</strong>, find <strong>Geodes</strong> and crack them to reveal rare gecko variants. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660830/extras/92bfeec0f95566041234952e766d42cb.poster.avif?t=1782461847\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660830/extras/92bfeec0f95566041234952e766d42cb.webm?t=1782461847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660830/extras/92bfeec0f95566041234952e766d42cb.mp4?t=1782461847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play with up to 5 additional friends.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite your Friends to one of your Worlds, and start from the beginning, or show them your entire production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split tasks and be productive, or have fun opening boxes and collecting together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660830/extras/e0225e5e91ee207f0c393d274d6c08a8.avif?t=1782461847\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660830/extras_big/e0225e5e91ee207f0c393d274d6c08a8.webp?t=1782461847 width=1560 height=384 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect, Breed, Sell, Repeat.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are tons of Geckos to discover, each with their own look, rarity, stats and value.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and open different Boxes to get random Geckos from that set.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your favorites and sell the valuable ones. Or send them to the Lab, to breed something completely new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660830/extras/6f278dc35839bfe74eb3c11b25a36164.poster.avif?t=1782461847\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660830/extras/6f278dc35839bfe74eb3c11b25a36164.webm?t=1782461847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660830/extras/6f278dc35839bfe74eb3c11b25a36164.mp4?t=1782461847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Machines for Everything.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every single task can be automated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open boxes, move geckos, sell products, breed mutations, incubate eggs, feed animals, harvest crops, manage orders and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start simple, then build bigger and faster machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660830/extras/e161ad22cd6a95eb0de94ed32660634f.avif?t=1782461847\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660830/extras_big/e161ad22cd6a95eb0de94ed32660634f.webp?t=1782461847 width=1560 height=384 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow a Garden to Feed your Geckos.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You now have your own Garden!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant Seeds to grow Fruits, catch Bugs, and use them to feed your Geckos. Grow useful resources, or plant beautiful decorations to make your rooms feel more alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decorate your Home and Keep your Collection.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Say hello to your own Home, that you can decorate however you want, and display your personal collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy home, a gecko museum, or a jungle of self-grown flowers?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Open boxes and collect geckos. Fuse them to create new mutations, then sell or keep 'em. Build huge factories and automate every single step.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660830/889c3f57e77548bd1ed2d47fe02fadc53f1596f4/header.jpg?t=1782461847", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660830/6c9342a08a930f665fb94c851849e689e98cde56/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782461847", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660830/6c9342a08a930